  "title": "Air Fryer Crab Rangoon",
  "description": "This air fryer recipe for crab Rangoon produces super crispy wonton puffs with warm and fluffy centers filled with cream cheese and tender crab meat.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
